}}'''Floral''' is a [[Rare Weapons|rare]] knife that was originally obtainable by collecting 8,200 [[Beach Balls (currency)|Beach Balls]] {{Currency|Beach Ball}} during the [[Summer Event 2023]]. It is now only available through trading as the event has since ended.

== Appearance ==
This knife uses the default knife mesh. Its blade is magenta with cyan flowers blooming on it, hence the name. Its guard is of the same cyan colour and the handle is maroon with cyan lines on it.
==Trivia==
*It partners with its own effect, [[Floral (Effect)|Floral]].
